rving the fingers or toes\"],[0,11,1810948,4617,\"n:05377979-n | intercostal vein | several veins draining the intercostal spaces of the rib cage\"],[0,11,1811390,4618,\"n:05381133-n | metacarpal vein | dorsal and palmar veins of the hand\"],[0,11,1811774,4619,\"n:05384714-n | popliteal vein | a vein arising in the knee and ascending to become the femoral vein\"],[0,11,1812218,4620,\"n:05385577-n | pulmonary vein | any of four veins that carry arterial blood from the lungs to the left atrium of the heart\"],[0,11,1812707,4621,\"n:05386382-n | radial vein | superficial veins ascending the radial side of the forearm\"],[0,11,1813123,4622,\"n:05390941-n | thyroid vein | any of several small veins draining blood from the thyroid area\"],[0,11,1813553,4623,\"n:05392504-n | gall bladder | a muscular sac attached to the liver that stores bile (secreted by the liver) until it is needed for digestion\"],[0,11,1814075,4624,\"n:05395780-n | visceral pleura | pleura that covers the lungs\"],[0,11,1814426,4625,\"n:05396148-n | heart | the hollow muscular organ located behind the sternum and between the lungs\"],[0,11,1814856,4626,\"n:05397282-n | heart muscle | the muscle tissue of the heart\"],[0,11,1815220,4627,\"n:05399106-n | heart ventricle | a chamber of the heart that receives blood from an atrium and pumps it to the arteries\"],[0,11,1815701,4628,\"n:05399320-n | left ventricle | the chamber on the left side of the heart that receives arterial blood from the left atrium and pumps it into the aorta\"],[0,11,1816231,4629,\"n:05399500-n | right ventricle | the chamber on the right side of the heart that receives venous blood from the right atrium and pumps it into the pulmonary trunk\"],[0,11,1816782,4630,\"n:05400087-n | chamber | an enclosed volume in the body\"],[0,11,1817110,4631,\"n:05404676-n | vas | a tube in which a body fluid circulates\"],[0,11,1817455,4632,\"n:05409434-n | clot | a lump of material formed from the content of a liquid\"],[0,11,1817835,4633,\"n:054