 on a warship or in a regiment etc.)\"],[0,11,2201819,5572,\"n:06508490-n | timetable | a schedule listing events and the times at which they will take place\"],[0,11,2202231,5573,\"n:06508764-n | church roll | a list of the members of church\"],[0,11,2202575,5574,\"n:06509004-n | waiting list | a roster of those waiting to obtain something\"],[0,11,2202950,5575,\"n:06509863-n | latin alphabet | the alphabet evolved by the ancient Romans which serves for writing most of the languages of western Europe\"],[0,11,2203474,5576,\"n:06511235-n | greek alphabet | the alphabet used by ancient Greeks\"],[0,11,2203835,5577,\"n:06511787-n | cyrillic alphabet | an alphabet derived from the Greek alphabet and used for writing Slavic languages (Russian, Bulgarian, Serbian, Ukrainian, and some other Slavic languages)\"],[0,11,2204459,5578,\"n:06512053-n | arabic alphabet | the alphabet of 28 characters derived from Aramaic and used for writing Arabic languages (and borrowed for writing Urdu)\"],[0,11,2204994,5579,\"n:06512439-n | phonetic alphabet | an alphabet of characters intended to represent specific sounds of speech\"],[0,11,2205459,5580,\"n:06512756-n | finger alphabet | an alphabet used by the deaf\"],[0,11,2205829,5581,\"n:06513132-n | patent | a document granting an inventor sole rights to an invention\"],[0,11,2206236,5582,\"n:06513302-n | political platform | a document stating the aims and principles of a political party\"],[0,11,2206712,5583,\"n:06513302-n | political program | a document stating the aims and principles of a political party\"],[0,11,2207186,5584,\"n:06514849-n | police blotter | the daily written record of events (as arrests) in a police station\"],[0,11,2207668,5585,\"n:06515715-n | entry | an item inserted in a written record\"],[0,11,2208002,5586,\"n:06516453-n | note | a brief written record\"],[0,11,2208305,5587,\"n:06517696-n | memorabilia | a record of things worth remembering\"],[0,11,2208657,5588,\"n:06518182-n | memo | a written proposal or reminder\"],[0,11,2209005,5589,\"n:06519583-n | won lost record | (sports) a record of win versus losses\"],[0,11,2209373,5590,\"n:06521201-n | computer file | (computer science) a file maintained in computer-readable form\"],[0,11,2209785,5591,\"n:06521666-n | binary file | (computer science) a computer file containing machine-readable information that must be read by an application\"],[0,11,2210287,5592,\"n:06522094-n | disk file | (computer science) a computer file stored on a magnetic disk and identified by a unique label\"],[0,11,2210749,5593,\"n:06522469-n | input file | (computer science) a computer file that contains data that serve as input to a device or program\"],[0,11,2211235,5594,\"n:06522968-n | text file | (computer science) a computer file that contains text (and possibly formatting instructions) using seven-bit ASCII characters\"],[0,11,2211774,5595,\"n:06523387-n | mug book | a file of mug shots (pictures of criminals that are kept on file by the police)\"],[0,11,2212216,5596,\"n:06523551-n | resignation | a formal document giving notice of your intention to resign\"],[0,11,2212614,5597,\"n:06523865-n | declaration | a formal expression by a meeting\"],[0,11,2212985,5598,\"n:06524315-n | joint resolution | a resolution passed by both houses of Congress which becomes legally binding when signed by the Chief Executive (or passed over the Chief Executive's veto)\"],[0,11,2213590,5599,\"n:06524571-n | application | a verbal or written request for assistance or employment or admission to a school\"],[0,11,2214032,5600,\"n:06525357-n | petition | a formal message requesting something that is submitted to an authority\"],[0,11,2214473,5601,\"n:06525755-n | appeal | request for a sum of money\"],[0,11,2214838,5602,\"n:06526871-n | case history | detailed record of the background of a person or group under study or treatment\"],[0,11,2215279,5603,\"n:06528078-n | autobiography | a biography of yourself\"],[0,11,2215613,5604,\"n:06528395-n | profile | biog