ar kind of activity\"],[0,11,2222960,5621,\"n:06545288-n | antitrust law | law intended to promote free competition in the market place by outlawing monopolies\"],[0,11,2223443,5622,\"n:06546539-n | public law | a law affecting the public at large\"],[0,11,2223792,5623,\"n:06547213-n | legislation | law enacted by a legislative body\"],[0,11,2224154,5624,\"n:06547467-n | enabling legislation | legislation that gives appropriate officials the authority to implement or enforce the law\"],[0,11,2224641,5625,\"n:06550096-n | blue law | a statute regulating work on Sundays\"],[0,11,2224986,5626,\"n:06550776-n | poor law | a law providing support for the poor\"],[0,11,2225331,5627,\"n:06551169-n | criminal law | the body of law dealing with crimes and their punishment\"],[0,11,2225726,5628,\"n:06551493-n | court order | a writ issued by a court of law requiring a person to do something or to refrain from doing something\"],[0,11,2226208,5629,\"n:06551761-n | decree | a legally binding command or decision entered on the court record (as if issued by a court or judge)\"],[0,11,2226715,5630,\"n:06552854-n | divestiture | an order to an offending party to rid itself of property\"],[0,11,2227108,5631,\"n:06553811-n | prohibition | a law forbidding the sale of alcoholic beverages\"],[0,11,2227484,5632,\"n:06556133-n | testament | a legal document declaring a person's wishes regarding the disposal of their property when they die\"],[0,11,2227975,5633,\"n:06557128-n | deed | a legal document signed and sealed and delivered to effect a transfer of property and to show the legal right to possess it\"],[0,11,2228514,5634,\"n:06557519-n | assignment | the instrument by which a claim or right or interest or property is transferred from one person to another\"],[0,11,2229003,5635,\"n:06559050-n | warrant | a writ from a court commanding police to perform specified acts\"],[0,11,2229397,5636,\"n:06559312-n | search warrant | a warrant authorizing law enforcement officials to search for 