uman resources of economic value\"],[0,11,3745556,9392,\"n:13375784-n | operating capital | capital available for the operations of a firm (e.g. manufacturing or transportation) as distinct from financial transactions and long-term improvements\"],[0,11,3746160,9393,\"n:13376519-n | capital account | (finance) an account of the net value of a business at a specified date\"],[0,11,3746596,9394,\"n:13377127-n | cash in hand | assets in the form of money\"],[0,11,3747001,9395,\"n:13377947-n | pocket | a supply of money\"],[0,11,3747300,9396,\"n:13378158-n | exchequer | the funds of a government or institution or individual\"],[0,11,3747695,9397,\"n:13379722-n | fund | a reserve of money set aside for some purpose\"],[0,11,3748062,9398,\"n:13380436-n | revolving fund | a fund which, if borrowed or used, is intended to be replenished so it may be loaned or spent repeatedly\"],[0,11,3748559,9399,\"n:13380745-n | nest egg | a fund of money put by as a reserve\"],[0,11,3748912,9400,\"n:13380863-n | bank account | a fund that a customer has entrusted to a bank and from which the customer can make withdrawals\"],[0,11,3749387,9401,\"n:13381671-n | trust | something (as property) held by one party (the trustee) for the benefit of another (the beneficiary)\"],[0,11,3749850,9402,\"n:13386459-n | bread and butter | the financial means whereby one lives\"],[0,11,3750281,9403,\"n:13387310-n | amenities | things that make you comfortable and at ease\"],[0,11,3750696,9404,\"n:13387484-n | maintenance | means of maintenance of a family or group\"],[0,11,3751058,9405,\"n:13387710-n | subsistence | minimal (or marginal) resources for subsisting\"],[0,11,3751430,9406,\"n:13388243-n | fund | a supply of something available for future use\"],[0,11,3751801,9407,\"n:13388960-n | seed stock | a supply of seeds (or tubers) reserved for planting\"],[0,11,3752182,9408,\"n:13389086-n | seed corn | good quality seeds (as kernels of corn) that are reserved for planting\"],[0,11,3752611,9409,\"n:133