 washing away of soil or other loose material by rain\"],[0,11,3803326,9529,\"n:13568583-n | redeposition | deposition from one deposit to another\"],[0,11,3803685,9530,\"n:13569128-n | refilling | filling again by supplying what has been used up\"],[0,11,3804101,9531,\"n:13569734-n | infrigidation | the process of cooling or freezing (e.g., food) for preservative purposes\"],[0,11,3804551,9532,\"n:13570875-n | release | a process that liberates or discharges something\"],[0,11,3804916,9533,\"n:13571521-n | reproduction | the process of generating offspring\"],[0,11,3805269,9534,\"n:13574763-n | lookup | an operation that determines whether one or more of a set of items has a specified property\"],[0,11,3805727,9535,\"n:13577452-n | slippage | a decrease of transmitted power in a mechanical system caused by slipping\"],[0,11,3806144,9536,\"n:13577712-n | drop off | a noticeable deterioration in performance or quality\"],[0,11,3806568,9537,\"n:13578096-n | smoke | a hot vapor containing fine particles of carbon being produced by combustion\"],[0,11,3806994,9538,\"n:13579693-n | sorption | the process in which one substance takes up or holds another (by either absorption or adsorption)\"],[0,11,3807460,9539,\"n:13584725-n | supply | offering goods and services for sale\"],[0,11,3807797,9540,\"n:13587415-n | temperature change | a process whereby the degree of hotness of a body (or medium) changes\"],[0,11,3808236,9541,\"n:13588131-n | thermal emission | the emission of electrons from very hot substances\"],[0,11,3808655,9542,\"n:13591439-n | transport | an exchange of molecules (and their kinetic energy and momentum) across the boundary between adjacent layers of a fluid or across cell membranes\"],[0,11,3809217,9543,\"n:13592420-n | flowering | a developmental process\"],[0,11,3809551,9544,\"n:13594571-n | vicious circle | one trouble leads to another that aggravates the first\"],[0,11,3809966,9545,\"n:13596131-n | word processing | rapid and efficient processing (st