e strength\"],[0,11,5094419,12965,\"v:00097837-v | resuscitate | cause to regain consciousness\"],[0,11,5094768,12966,\"v:00098271-v | raise | cause to become alive again\"],[0,11,5095110,12967,\"v:00098938-v | heal | get healthy again\"],[0,11,5095403,12968,\"v:00099271-v | conk out | use up all one's strength and energy and stop working\"],[0,11,5095832,12969,\"v:00099475-v | exercise | do physical exercise\"],[0,11,5096156,12970,\"v:00099798-v | train | exercise in order to prepare for an event or competition\"],[0,11,5096530,12971,\"v:00100164-v | roll | execute a roll, in tumbling\"],[0,11,5096843,12972,\"v:00100659-v | warm up | cause to do preliminary exercises so as to stretch the muscles\"],[0,11,5097235,12973,\"v:00101710-v | ptyalise | expel or eject (saliva or phlegm or sputum) from the mouth\"],[0,11,5097663,12974,\"v:00102057-v | spit out | spit up in an explosive manner\"],[0,11,5098019,12975,\"v:00102545-v | salivate | produce saliva\"],[0,11,5098319,12976,\"v:00104622-v | discharge | eliminate (a substance)\"],[0,11,5098683,12977,\"v:00105087-v | breathe | expel (gases or odors)\"],[0,11,5099026,12978,\"v:00105308-v | jest | act in a funny or teasing way\"],[0,11,5099352,12979,\"v:00106914-v | pack on | gain (weight)\"],[0,11,5099646,12980,\"v:00109468-v | change | undergo a change\"],[0,11,5099943,12981,\"v:00114965-v | convert | change the nature, purpose, or function of something\"],[0,11,5100316,12982,\"v:00117154-v | receive | convert into sounds or pictures\"],[0,11,5100646,12983,\"v:00118572-v | follow | keep informed\"],[0,11,5100966,12984,\"v:00120124-v | get | give certain properties to something\"],[0,11,5101303,12985,\"v:00120483-v | render | cause to become\"],[0,11,5101598,12986,\"v:00120854-v | experience | undergo\"],[0,11,5101898,12987,\"v:00121314-v | alternate | go back and forth\"],[0,11,5102224,12988,\"v:00121734-v | counterchange | cause to change places\"],[0,11,5102584,12989,\"v:00122456-v | crackle | to become, or to cause to become, covered with a network of small cracks\"],[0,11,5102997,12990,\"v:00122978-v | alter | become different in some particular way, without permanently losing one's or its former characteristics or essence\"],[0,11,5103507,12991,\"v:00124250-v | move | go or proceed from one point to another\"],[0,11,5103844,12992,\"v:00125255-v | glass | become glassy or take on a glass-like appearance\"],[0,11,5104242,12993,\"v:00135386-v | demythologise | remove the mythical element from (writings)\"],[0,11,5104642,12994,\"v:00135665-v | bring | bring into a different state\"],[0,11,5104969,12995,\"v:00136608-v | equilibrate | bring to a chemical stasis or equilibrium\"],[0,11,5105331,12996,\"v:00137133-v | affect | have an effect upon\"],[0,11,5105694,12997,\"v:00138328-v | change by reversal | change to the contrary\"],[0,11,5106060,12998,\"v:00138980-v | turn the tables | cause a complete reversal of the circumstances\"],[0,11,5106462,12999,\"v:00141452-v | tie | form a knot or bow in\"],[0,11,5106760,13000,\"v:00142011-v | form | give shape or form to\"],[0,11,5107071,13001,\"v:00143024-v | roll | shape by rolling\"],[0,11,5107362,13002,\"v:00143360-v | strike | cause to form (an electric arc) between electrodes of an arc lamp\"],[0,11,5107758,13003,\"v:00143734-v | twist | form into twists\"],[0,11,5108052,13004,\"v:00144967-v | round | make round\"],[0,11,5108362,13005,\"v:00145958-v | change state | undergo a transformation or a change of position or action\"],[0,11,5108770,13006,\"v:00147635-v | fall | pass suddenly and passively into a state of body or mind\"],[0,11,5109141,13007,\"v:00148292-v | fall away | diminish in size or intensity\"],[0,11,5109486,13008,\"v:00148417-v | fall in love | begin to experience feelings of love towards\"],[0,11,5109857,13009,\"v:00148583-v | suspend | cause to be held in suspension in a fluid\"],[0,11,5110207,13010,\"v:00148787-v | resuspend | put back into suspension\"],[0,11,5110529,13011,\"v:00148938-v | sober | become sober aft